---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do not overuse gradients, glassmorphism, neon glows, or oversized shadows.
- Prefer restrained color palettes with 1 accent color maximum.
- Use clear information hierarchy before decorative visuals.
- Avoid excessive border-radius on every component.
- Avoid landing-page clichés unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer asymmetric but intentional layouts over repetitive identical cards.
- Every section must have a clear product purpose, not just visual filler.
- Prioritize readability, spacing consistency, and realistic UX patterns.
- If a UI pattern looks trendy but harms usability, choose usability.
- Before finalizing, critique the design for “AI-generated sameness” and revise it.
